                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Company of Heroes 2 is a solid, tense WWII strategy game with satisfying tactical combat, strong battlefield atmosphere, and a campaign that gives a gritty look at the Eastern Front. Positioning, cover, and resource control all matter, which makes every win feel earned. It can also be punishing, especially on higher difficulties where the AI doesn’t hold back and mistakes get punished quickly. If you’re a trophy hunter, be prepared for a real grind, because some of the achievements are tough and will test your patience and skill. It has a few rough edges, but it’s a rewarding game for strategy fans who enjoy a challenge. 7/10",
